    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated clinicians alongside communication critiques"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many long-term clients praise the veterinary surgeons and technicians for their compassion, dedication, and gentle bedside manner during routine exams and procedures. However, several reviewers note feeling rushed or dismissed during busy consultation shifts, and a few pet owners report impersonal communication when dealing with critical or stressful situations."
      },
      "mentions": 46,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate care for household pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently describe the staff as caring and affectionate toward dogs and cats during checkups and vaccinations. Families appreciate that many veterinary nurses display genuine love for animals and strive to comfort nervous pets. The clinic accommodates pets of all ages, from young puppies to elderly rescue dogs."
      },
      "mentions": 29,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "title": {
        "en": "Positive routine outcomes with clinical concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners report dependable outcomes for basic vaccinations, parasite preventatives, and routine health certificates. Conversely, several clients express serious distress following complicated medical cases, medication side effects, or difficult end-of-life decisions, feeling that diagnostic options and prognoses were not sufficiently addressed."
      },
      "mentions": 19,
      "sentiment": "mixed"
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does Alamo Dog and Cat Hospital accept walk-in patients?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the clinic accepts walk-ins alongside booked visits seven days a week, though wait times may be longer during peak hours."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are emergency or urgent care services available?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The hospital provides urgent care during operating hours and coordinates with after-hours partner emergency facilities for overnight care."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can clients schedule appointments online?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet owners can request consultations online, although phone confirmation is recommended during busy clinic periods."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What routine veterinary services does the hospital provide?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The hospital provides wellness checks, routine vaccinations, dental care, microchipping, and general veterinary surgery for companion animals."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    }
